 ],
 "lean_claims": [
  {"theorem": "primary_covariance_average", "line": 33, "plain": "Hypotheses: vectors vr, vt with det(vr,vt) ≠ 0; any center; ci > 0 and any r0; χ, ψ, x, t continuous; χ and ψ compactly supported; i ∈ Fin 2; n ∈ ℕ; any phase function; integer j ≠ 0. Let a(z) be the periodization of the native field of the transverse-stretched pulse profile in the slot chart, evaluated at covering^[n](z). Conclusion: squareAverage_z of angularMean_θ[a(z)·cos²(jθ+phase z)] = (|det|/2)·∫χ²·actualColumn(ci,ψ,x,t)_i."}
 ],
